    "detailed_description": "<strong>More Games</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/2acb0a5741afca3932d9c7c85552d0e9.avif?t=1677343769\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/d167b7baa8ef05815bcb28e2362f5f14.avif?t=1677343769\" /></div><br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>In Virium, you have an ability to walk on anything which helps you navigate the twisted organic terrain. Use walls and ceilings to your advantage to overcome puzzles as well as hide from dangerous enemies. However, you can also climb enemies to either fight them by targeting specific weak points on their bodies, or use them to your advantage as a way of transport or a bridge. Explore the world and evolve, by unlocking different forms with their own mechanics.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/7b694a1ed1a5dc0ed8ee9c5f3a60fc49.poster.avif?t=1677343769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/7b694a1ed1a5dc0ed8ee9c5f3a60fc49.webm?t=1677343769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/7b694a1ed1a5dc0ed8ee9c5f3a60fc49.mp4?t=1677343769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Navigate through twisted organic terrain<br></li><li> Climb large enemies to interact with them<br></li><li> Solve world puzzles by utilizing the organic environment<br></li><li> Unlock unique forms, each with their own mechanics<br></li><li> Explore the open world map</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>More Games</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/2acb0a5741afca3932d9c7c85552d0e9.avif?t=1677343769\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/d167b7baa8ef05815bcb28e2362f5f14.avif?t=1677343769\" /></div><br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>In Virium, you have an ability to walk on anything which helps you navigate the twisted organic terrain. Use walls and ceilings to your advantage to overcome puzzles as well as hide from dangerous enemies. However, you can also climb enemies to either fight them by targeting specific weak points on their bodies, or use them to your advantage as a way of transport or a bridge. Explore the world and evolve, by unlocking different forms with their own mechanics.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/7b694a1ed1a5dc0ed8ee9c5f3a60fc49.poster.avif?t=1677343769\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/7b694a1ed1a5dc0ed8ee9c5f3a60fc49.webm?t=1677343769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923230/extras/7b694a1ed1a5dc0ed8ee9c5f3a60fc49.mp4?t=1677343769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Navigate through twisted organic terrain<br></li><li> Climb large enemies to interact with them<br></li><li> Solve world puzzles by utilizing the organic environment<br></li><li> Unlock unique forms, each with their own mechanics<br></li><li> Explore the open world map</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Navigate and explore the twisted organic world with the ability to walk on anything! Climb large creatures, solve puzzles, unlock different forms and abilities, and uncover secrets in this atmospheric Puzzle-Metroidvania.",
